WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.747
If the founder is still the person holding sales, follow-up, delivery coordination, and key decisions together, growth is borrowing against the founder's calendar.

00:00:09.747 --> 00:00:19.917
David serves as a temporary revenue operating partner, protecting the founder's highest-value work while taking ownership of preparation, follow-through, account movement, and operating coordination.

00:00:19.917 --> 00:00:25.003
The point is to create durable capacity while live revenue work continues.

00:00:25.003 --> 00:00:31.359
The engagement begins with defined responsibilities, a weekly operating rhythm, and a measurable time-and-revenue baseline.

00:00:31.359 --> 00:00:38.563
The proof is founder hours returned without pipeline or customer commitments being dropped, alongside measurable commercial progress.

00:00:38.563 --> 00:00:44.870
If buying back founder time is now a growth requirement, book a qualified fifteen-minute conversation.
